WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.291
- What did you do?

00:00:01.291 --> 00:00:03.877
- I thought it was gonna be
really easy and it wasn't.

00:00:03.877 --> 00:00:05.679
Why did it do that?

00:00:05.679 --> 00:00:08.010
(electronic music)

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:11.180
Today, YouTube is going to teach
us how to cut our own hair.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.730
I'm not as nervous as
I probably should be.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:13.980
- I'm scared shitless, so

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.900
let's see where that goes.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.570
The first 30 minutes, we're gonna

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:19.130
be watching a tutorial video.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.240
After that, we get 30
minutes to cut our own hair.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.617
And then right after, we'll
be going around the office

00:00:24.617 --> 00:00:27.950
asking people how much they
think our haircut cost.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.210
- Wait, you're not
going to take any notes?

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.360
You're just going by memory?

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.310
- Oh yeah, of course.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:33.910
- Do you, I'm not telling
you how to live your life.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.420
- None of this is helping me at all.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.140
- Are you scrubbing through your tutorial?

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.210
- Yeah, because I'm impatient, I'm sorry.

00:00:45.908 --> 00:00:47.180
- Are you ready to cut your hair?

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.570
- I have no choice, so

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:52.490
let's just get this over with, please.

00:00:53.456 --> 00:00:54.289
- Let's cut some hair.

00:00:54.289 --> 00:00:55.300
30 minutes starts now.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.480
- Now.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.140
- This just got so real.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:01.580
I'm doing my ponytail
at the top of my head.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.250
Holy moly.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.083
- Oh, shit.

00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:05.250
I'm going to start with an eight.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.620
Meaning that it's not
going to cut that much.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.000
Why did it just go weak?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.670
It's literally just vibrating.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.273
Ah, thank you.

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:15.106
- There you go.

00:01:15.106 --> 00:01:18.190
I'm supposed to cut right
above this hair tie.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:19.710
Here goes nothing.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:22.364
It's not going through as
easily as I thought it would.

00:01:22.364 --> 00:01:23.600
I'm cutting it crooked, what's happening?

00:01:26.673 --> 00:01:29.353
(Ken gasps)

00:01:29.353 --> 00:01:32.614
Look at this, that's not how
that was supposed to happen.

00:01:32.614 --> 00:01:33.620
- Syd.

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:34.810
That's my hair.

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:37.610
Okay, remove this and make
it into three sections.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:38.443
Okay.

00:01:38.443 --> 00:01:39.790
Fuck, look at this.

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:41.922
What am I doing, you guys?

00:01:41.922 --> 00:01:44.450
(rock music)

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:47.470
So here's the one that I've
like fixed a little bit,

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.910
versus the one that has not been fixed.

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:51.680
And I feel like they look better.

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:52.513
(razor buzzing)

00:01:52.513 --> 00:01:53.618
- There's no going back now.

00:01:53.618 --> 00:01:54.451
Oh, man.

00:01:54.451 --> 00:01:56.610
- It still looks pretty blunt.

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:58.980
I'm going to do what I just did over.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.060
How much time do we have?

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:00.930
- 17 minutes.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:01.905
- 17 minutes, okay.

00:02:01.905 --> 00:02:04.050
(upbeat music)

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:04.977
- Going in the back.

00:02:04.977 --> 00:02:06.550
How do they do this?

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:09.250
- It actually, I don't
think it looks that bad.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:12.280
I mean, it gets a little rough over here.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.650
Oh my gosh, wait.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.380
Oh my gosh wait, look at this.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:19.204
I don't know how to fix this.

00:02:19.204 --> 00:02:21.380
- Oh, Jesus.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:22.910
- Now I'm straying from the tutorial.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.250
I'm just going by memory.

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.560
The last time I got my haircut in August.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:29.080
I'm just trying to remember
what my hairstylist does.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.460
But I don't think she's ever
fucked up my hair this bad.

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:34.331
She definitely hasn't,
she's wonderful at her job.

00:02:34.331 --> 00:02:35.785
- We have 12 minutes

00:02:35.785 --> 00:02:36.618
You know what, fuck it.

00:02:36.618 --> 00:02:39.031
I'll just have to go to this
side because this looks...

00:02:39.031 --> 00:02:40.870
Oh man, I fucked up so bad.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:43.570
- Was my hair this long when we started?

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:46.570
Yeah, okay so it looks
like I only cut this much

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:49.397
and this stuff right
here is just hanging out.

00:02:49.397 --> 00:02:51.618
- I think I feel a lot more
confident on this side.

00:02:51.618 --> 00:02:54.670
I think it's going to look
way better on the right side.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:56.540
Oh yeah, okay.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.200
Now I'm getting the hang of this.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.140
- Well, I'm not.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.210
I'm just gonna,

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:01.570
there goes my hair.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.100
It's on the ground now.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.880
- I think I should just
give up on my back.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.540
- This is not what this is
supposed to look like you guys.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.260
I know what a haircut's
supposed to look like,

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:11.360
and this isn't it.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.550
Okay well, I think I give up now, so.

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:15.169
- Well, I can't really give up because

00:03:15.169 --> 00:03:18.770
at least I want to look
decent when I come out here.

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:21.650
- Maybe it's something where
our coworkers will not know.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:24.300
- No. (laughs)

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.460
Please be merciful.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.071
- Hey, the alarm's going off.

00:03:27.071 --> 00:03:29.487
(Ken groans)

00:03:29.487 --> 00:03:30.800
(Ken laughs)

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.100
- I mean, it's not like totally even,

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.090
but I don't think it looks as bad

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:33.923
as you think it does.

00:03:33.923 --> 00:03:34.950
- Compare this side.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:35.783
- Okay.

00:03:35.783 --> 00:03:36.630
- To this side.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:37.830
- That side looks much better.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.200
- Well, here's my hair.

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:42.212
- Honestly, if I look from far away,

00:03:42.212 --> 00:03:43.520
oh, wait.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:44.870
(laughing)

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.040
- Before we've asked
anybody their opinions,

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.520
would you do this again?

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:49.450
- Definitely not.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.440
- I absolutely would not.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.010
- I think I've learned my lesson.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:54.140
- I've learned my lesson.

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:54.973
But, I don't know.

00:03:54.973 --> 00:03:57.170
I'm excited to see what
our coworkers have to say.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.800
- I'm not (laughing).

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.030
- How much do I think you
paid for your haircut?

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:02.430
70 dollars?

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.917
- I cut it myself.

00:04:03.917 --> 00:04:05.580
- (laughing) What?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.110
Okay, now that you point it
out, yeah, it's a little blunt.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:10.292
It's a little blunt.

00:04:10.292 --> 00:04:12.050
(laughing)

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.340
Oh that's fucked up.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:17.730
- It definitely smells
like it was blow dried,

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.750
so I think you got it done.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:21.440
- That's just your regular hair smell?

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.375
Damn, you have nice-smelling
hair. (laughing)

00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:27.470
- Okay, it smells like you just showered.

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:29.950
- Okay, I think they're low-end haircuts.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.120
- Are they the same or different?

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.026
I think you did them yourselves.

00:04:33.026 --> 00:04:34.080
- [Ken] We did.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.132
- I know, I can tell.

00:04:36.132 --> 00:04:37.010
(all laughing)

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.730
- The only reason is that
there's one little part

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:40.830
that's like not fully blended.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.150
- A little uneven in the back.

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:45.012
Yours looks great.

00:04:45.012 --> 00:04:46.700
But also a little uneven.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.060
Did you like do these to each other?

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:50.480
- [Sydnee] We did them to ourselves.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:51.520
- To yourselves?

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.490
That's impressive.

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:55.378
Like, honestly, wow.

00:04:55.378 --> 00:04:59.590
Yeah, they definitely don't
look like expensive haircuts.

00:05:00.425 --> 00:05:03.092
(upbeat music)

